I've been playing a rogue on vanilla - previous rogue got stuck on the
quest level, having stepped on a level teleport trap *after* drinking
his last cursed !oGL, *and* got teleported to the quest level, far,
far from the upstairs,  *and* burning all cursed ?oTele without
getting ported out, *and* not getting a corpse from any of the
chameleons, even though he had a ring of polycontrol.

Anyway my current rogue has completed both castle and quest without
getting stuck.  However, she is woefully underequipped - still wearing
a bunch of minetown armor: elven mithril, hard hat, iron shoes.  She
did get Magicbane from an early wish, which helps up the backstab
probabilities, and found a polished silver shield early.  Also got
crowned pretty early while praying for holy water, so she has a
Stormbringer stuck in a stash (too risky to use, since Magicbane is
the only MR she has), *and* got Sting as a sacrifice gift.  No low-
level escape spells to practice on, although she's gotten divination
and matter to basic; unfortunately did not get ID and mapping
spellbooks yet.

Early ID scrolls were bad luck: each of the 2-3 ID scrolls total found
and blessed just ID'ed 2 items each.

She had managed to clear mines except for the last level, which had an
archlich (probably from a polytrap), so she had just rushed to the
luckstone, engraving E-word all over and zapping with a telewand non-E-
word-scared monsters to stop the archlich's crowd until she managed to
sneak to the luckstone, and got out by a ?oTele.  Didn't get BoH
though (Sokoban gave reflection).  Never managed to get BoH until
reaching castle, got the 0:2 wand, and wished for 3 blessed scrolls of
charging (got 3) and a BoH.  wish 1:3 got a blessed ring of
levitation, since she had managed to fall through a trap door to below
Medusa - turned out that one of the rings she was carrying (which she
hadn't worn because I hadn't BUC-id'ed them) was also levi.  After
getting rid of Medusa and flying back to stash, wished (1:2) for a
magic marker to write some ID scrolls and ID all the varied jewelry
and scrolls.

I haven't found any gray dragon scales yet, but I do have yellow and
white in the stash.

Killed the minetown priestess after reaching VotD, so I have a nice
new robe now.  Her spellbooks were healing and detect monster though,
which I already had.

Among some of the things I *don't* have:

Geno scrolls.  Not identified yet (I would have reverse geno'ed some
gray dragons to get their hides).

Decent helm.  Just recently picked up a +1 HoOA though, but obviously
I'm not very interested in using it *yet*.

Jump or speed boots.  Nope, just iron ones.  Got what I suspect was
waterwalking but I misplaced it somewhere.

Decent spells.  No cone of cold, no fire ball, no polymorph, no
teleport away, no magic mapping, no identify, no polymorph.  Does have
haste self but can't practice it, 99% failure.  Does have magic
missile.

T-shirt.  I suppose I'll have to make do with the shield of reflect.

So: I have two assured wishes left, and I don't know how to get at the
stuff I'm missing.  Since I'm crowned it's very slow to pray for
spellbooks, and I'm just missing too many items.  I do have a
polywand, so I suppose I should start polypiling.  Any ideas?


